			<heading>
				Restore Us, O God
			</heading>
			<heading>
				To the choirmaster: according to Lilies. A Testimony. Of Asaph, a Psalm.
			</heading>
			<begin-paragraph>
			</begin-paragraph>
			<v n="1">You who are enthroned upon the cherubim,<crossref let="g" cid="c19080001.1" />shine forth.</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v19080002">
			</marker>
			<v n="2">come to save us!</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v19080003">
			</marker>
			<v n="3">let your face shine, that we may be saved!</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v19080004">
			</marker>
			<v n="4">how long will you be angry with your people's prayers?</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v19080005">
			</marker>
			<v n="5">and given them tears to drink in full measure.</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v19080006">
			</marker>
			<v n="6">and our enemies laugh among themselves.</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v19080007">
			</marker>
			<v n="7">let your face shine, that we may be saved!</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v19080008">
			</marker>
			<v n="8">you<crossref let="t" cid="c19080008.1" />drove out the nations and planted it.</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v19080009">
			</marker>
			<v n="9">it took deep root and filled the land.</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v19080010">
			</marker>
			<v n="10">the mighty cedars with its branches.</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v19080011">
			</marker>
			<v n="11">and its shoots to<crossref let="w" cid="c19080011.1" />the River.</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v19080012">
			</marker>
			<v n="12">so that all who pass along the way pluck its fruit?</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v19080013">
			</marker>
			<v n="13">and all that move in the field feed on it.</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v19080014">
			</marker>
			<v n="14">have regard for this vine,</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v19080015">
			</marker>
			<v n="15">and for the son whom you made strong for yourself.</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v19080016">
			</marker>
			<v n="16">the rebuke of your face!</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v19080017">
			</marker>
			<v n="17">the son of man whom you have made strong for yourself!</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v19080018">
			</marker>
			<v n="18">give us life, and we will call upon your name!</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v19080019">
			</marker>
			<v n="19">Let your face shine, that we may be saved!</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v19080020">
			</marker>
